2f:["$","section","3-Find the right authority through your university",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Find the right authority through your university"}],[["$","p","DSU is a broad right-to-study framework, not one national form with one deadline. Start on your university’s official benefits page and identify the responsible regional body or institution. Match the campus as well as the university name.",{"children":"DSU is a broad right-to-study framework, not one national form with one deadline. Start on your university’s official benefits page and identify the responsible regional body or institution. Match the campus as well as the university name."}],["$","p","For example, Bologna directs students into ER.GO procedures; institutions in Piedmont can use EDISU Piemonte. Lazio, Tuscany, Milan and Padua have their own published routes. Confirm institutional coverage in the current notice before preparing financial documents.",{"children":"For example, Bologna directs students into ER.GO procedures; institutions in Piedmont can use EDISU Piemonte. Lazio, Tuscany, Milan and Padua have their own published routes. Confirm institutional coverage in the current notice before preparing financial documents."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Find the right authority through your university","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/","children":["DSU eligibility and benefit guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/scholarships/edisu-piemonte/",{"href":"/scholarships/edisu-piemonte/","children":["EDISU Piemonte guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/countries/italy/",{"href":"/countries/italy/","children":["Italy destination hub",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
30:["$","section","4-If you already submitted: work from your receipt",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"If you already submitted: work from your receipt"}],[["$","p","Save the submitted form, application reference and time. Log in through the official portal to check whether the request is complete, suspended, provisionally assessed or awaiting a further action. Those labels need to be interpreted under the actual notice.",{"children":"Save the submitted form, application reference and time. Log in through the official portal to check whether the request is complete, suspended, provisionally assessed or awaiting a further action. Those labels need to be interpreted under the actual notice."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"If you already submitted: work from your receipt","children":[["$","li","Find the submitted application and latest official communication.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Find the submitted application and latest official communication."}]]}],["$","li","Record every remaining evidence or confirmation date separately.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Record every remaining evidence or confirmation date separately."}]]}],["$","li","Check the required foreign-income/asset reference year and document route.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check the required foreign-income/asset reference year and document route."}]]}],["$","li","Read accommodation and ranking instructions for your category.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Read accommodation and ranking instructions for your category."}]]}],["$","li","Keep proof of uploads, corrections and any accepted extension.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Keep proof of uploads, corrections and any accepted extension."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
31:["$","section","5-If you missed the main application",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"If you missed the main application"}],[["$","p","Check whether the authority has expressly published a late route or an extension covering your category. If not, do not assume that an active login page or later document date lets you apply. Ask the benefits office a precise question and retain its official answer.",{"children":"Check whether the authority has expressly published a late route or an extension covering your category. If not, do not assume that an active login page or later document date lets you apply. Ask the benefits office a precise question and retain its official answer."}],["$","p","Compare university fee reductions, other verified awards and a budget without an unconfirmed grant. A closed DSU competition does not itself mean admission is closed. It does mean the expected benefit should not be counted as confirmed income.",{"children":"Compare university fee reductions, other verified awards and a budget without an unconfirmed grant. A closed DSU competition does not itself mean admission is closed. It does mean the expected benefit should not be counted as confirmed income."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for If you missed the main application","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/italy-universities-tuition-fees/",{"href":"/guides/italy-universities-tuition-fees/","children":["University fees and reductions",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/cost-of-living-in-italy-for-students/",{"href":"/guides/cost-of-living-in-italy-for-students/","children":["National student budget method",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
32:["$","section","6-Prepare for the next call without inventing its date",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare for the next call without inventing its date"}],[["$","p","The reviewed evidence does not establish one confirmed 2027/28 DSU calendar. Previous dates can help organise preparation, but they must be labelled historical rather than announced. Watch the authority’s official call page and the university benefits office.",{"children":"The reviewed evidence does not establish one confirmed 2027/28 DSU calendar. Previous dates can help organise preparation, but they must be labelled historical rather than announced. Watch the authority’s official call page and the university benefits office."}],["$","p","Prepare a document inventory: household composition, income and assets, qualification/enrolment details and any translation or legalisation requested by the future notice. The required reference years can change, so do not order a full set based only on an old checklist.",{"children":"Prepare a document inventory: household composition, income and assets, qualification/enrolment details and any translation or legalisation requested by the future notice. The required reference years can change, so do not order a full set based only on an old checklist."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L35",null,{"id":"guides/dsu-italy-deadlines-by-region:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["Responsible authority and institution coverage confirmed.","Study category and applicant status recorded.","Original application and separate document dates distinguished.","Latest amendment saved.","Next-year dates labelled unannounced until a call exists."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Prepare for the next call without inventing its date","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/isee-parificato-international-students/",{"href":"